<title>USA: ITT Industries Inc Q1 net income rises.</title>
<headline>ITT Industries Inc Q1 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.37		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net			 44,300		   40,000</p>
<p> Sales		  2,166,600		2,200,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 120,600		  120,200</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Total sales of $2.2 billion were down $34.3 million from the first quarter of 1996 due to the disposition of certain non-core operations and foreign exchange translation.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 1997 estimates $0.34.</p>
</text>
